  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Thinly slice onion. Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and 1/2 the garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer to a small bowl. Stir in Greek-style yoghurt. Season to taste with salt and pepper and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb1806404b7ebc5afd3/step-d31bb000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook remaining garlic and 1/2 the carrot, stirring, until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add the water (for the couscous) and stock powder and bring to the boil.\n• Stir in couscous. Cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb1806404b7ebc5afd3/step-8bd80210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion, chickpeas and the remaining carrot until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium-high and add tomato & herb seasoning and passata. Cook, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in the water (for the stew), brown sugar and remaining butter and cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb1806404b7ebc5afd3/step-01bd3420.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine rocket leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Divide carrot couscous and rocket between bowls.\n• Top couscous with Mediterranean chickpea stew.\n• Drizzle with garlic yoghurt. Crumble over fetta cubes to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb1806404b7ebc5afd3/step-0382f630.jpeg"
    }
  ]
